<title>USA: 1st Source files for securities offer.</title>
<headline>1st Source files for securities offer.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH BEND, Ind. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st Source Corp said Friday it filed a registration statement to offer $55 million of Cumulative Trust Preferred Securities by two of its Delaware business trust subsidiaries.</p>
<p>1st Source is a bank holding company with assets of $2.1 billion and 42 banking centers.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 5/16 Friday at 24.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
